{"id":"thiefmd","name":"ThiefMD","tagline":"The markdown editor worth stealing","blurb":"Keep your Markdown managed.","description":"Keep your Markdown managed. Write epic tales, a novel, that screen play, keep a journal, or finally write that book report.\n\nThiefMD is a Markdown Editor providing an easy way to organize, format, and compile your markdown documents. When you're ready to Publish, go to ePub, PDF, Office, Ghost, WordPress, Write-Freely, or more.\n\nImport from and Export to Office, ePUB, HTML, and more. ThiefMD is your one stop shop for making and managing markdown mischief.\n\nWorking on a screenplay? ThiefMD can handle and combine Fountain files as well. Write your novel and prepare for that movie deal all from the same app.","developer":"kmwallio","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/github/kmwallio.thiefmd/f913ca5a70e5eae93cb1076ab7d3ede1/icons/128x128/com.github.kmwallio.thiefmd.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/github/kmwallio.thiefmd/f913ca5a70e5eae93cb1076ab7d3ede1/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/github/kmwallio.thiefmd/f913ca5a70e5eae93cb1076ab7d3ede1/screenshots/image-1_1248x781@1.png","w":1363,"h":853},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/github/kmwallio.thiefmd/f913ca5a70e5eae93cb1076ab7d3ede1/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/github/kmwallio.thiefmd/f913ca5a70e5eae93cb1076ab7d3ede1/screenshots/image-2_752x518@1.png","w":1026,"h":707},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/github/kmwallio.thiefmd/f913ca5a70e5eae93cb1076ab7d3ede1/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/github/kmwallio.thiefmd/f913ca5a70e5eae93cb1076ab7d3ede1/screenshots/image-3_1248x781@1.png","w":1363,"h":853},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/github/kmwallio.thiefmd/f913ca5a70e5eae93cb1076ab7d3ede1/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/github/kmwallio.thiefmd/f913ca5a70e5eae93cb1076a